{
    "chapter_num": 20,
    "verses_count": 38,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Journeys in Greece"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After the uproar had ceased, Paul called the disciples to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "himself,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " embraced "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and departed to go to Macedonia. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when he had gone over that region and encouraged them with many words, he came to Greece "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and stayed three months. And when the Jews plotted against him as he was about to sail to Syria, he decided to return through Macedonia. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Sopater of Berea accompanied him to Asia—also Aristarchus and Secundus of the Thessalonians, and Gaius of Derbe, and Timothy, and Tychicus and Trophimus of Asia. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "These men, going ahead, waited for us at Troas. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But we sailed away from Philippi after the Days of Unleavened Bread, and in five days joined them at Troas, where we stayed seven days."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Ministering at Troas"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now on the first "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "day"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the week, when the disciples came together to break bread, Paul, ready to depart the next day, spoke to them and continued his message until midnight. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "There were many lamps in the upper room where "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M we"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "they were gathered together. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And in a window sat a certain young man named Eutychus, who was sinking into a deep sleep. He was overcome by sleep; and as Paul continued speaking, he fell down from the third story and was taken up dead. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But Paul went down, fell on him, and embracing "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " said, “Do not trouble yourselves, for his life is in him.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when he had come up, had broken bread and eaten, and talked a long while, even till daybreak, he departed. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they brought the young man in alive, and they were not a little comforted."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "From Troas to Miletus"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then we went ahead to the ship and sailed to Assos, there intending to take Paul on board; for so he had "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "arranged it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "given orders, intending himself to go on foot. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when he met us at Assos, we took him on board and came to Mitylene. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "We sailed from there, and the next "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "day"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " came opposite Chios. The following "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "day"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " we arrived at Samos and stayed at Trogyllium. The next "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "day"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " we came to Miletus. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For Paul had decided to sail past Ephesus, so that he would not have to spend time in Asia; for he was hurrying to be at Jerusalem, if possible, on the Day of Pentecost."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Ephesian Elders Exhorted"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "From Miletus he sent to Ephesus and called for the elders of the church. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when they had come to him, he said to them: “You know, from the first day that I came to Asia, in what manner I always lived among you, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "serving the Lord with all humility, with many tears and trials which happened to me by the plotting of the Jews; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "how I kept back nothing that was helpful, but proclaimed it to you, and taught you publicly and from house to house, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "testifying to Jews, and also to Greeks, repentance toward God and faith toward our Lord Jesus Christ. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And see, now I go bound in the spirit to Jerusalem, not knowing the things that will happen to me there, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "except that the Holy Spirit testifies in every city, saying that chains and tribulations await me. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU But I do not count my life of any value or dear to myself"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But none of these things move me; nor do I count my life dear to myself, so that I may finish my "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "course"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "race with joy, and the ministry which I received from the Lord Jesus, to testify to the gospel of the grace of God."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“And indeed, now I know that you all, among whom I have gone preaching the kingdom of God, will see my face no more. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore I testify to you this day that I "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "am"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " innocent"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. clean"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the blood of all "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "men."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For I have not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "avoided declaring"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "shunned to declare to you the whole counsel of God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore take heed to yourselves and to all the flock, among which the Holy Spirit has made you overseers, to shepherd the church "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "M of the Lord and God"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of God which He purchased with His own blood. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For I know this, that after my departure savage wolves will come in among you, not sparing the flock. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Also from among yourselves men will rise up, speaking "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "misleading"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "perverse things, to draw away the disciples after themselves. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore watch, and remember that for three years I did not cease to warn everyone night and day with tears."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“So now, brethren, I commend you to God and to the word of His grace, which is able to build you up and give you an inheritance among all those who are sanctified. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I have coveted no one’s silver or gold or apparel. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit Yes"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Yes, you yourselves know that these hands have provided for my necessities, and for those who were with me. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 35,
                    "num_str": "35",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I have shown you in every way, by laboring like this, that you must support the weak. And remember the words of the Lord Jesus, that He said, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "‘It is more blessed to give than to receive.’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " ”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 36,
                    "num_str": "36",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when he had said these things, he knelt down and prayed with them all. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 37,
                    "num_str": "37",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then they all wept "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. much"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "freely, and fell on Paul’s neck and kissed him, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 38,
                    "num_str": "38",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "sorrowing most of all for the words which he spoke, that they would see his face no more. And they accompanied him to the ship."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}